{"id": "swebq0149", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Wassily K andinsky was a Russian-born abstract artist who is considered one of the pioneers of modern art. He's known for his colorful, non-representational works that often feature geometric shapes, lines, and vibrant colors. His paintings are full of energy and movement, reflecting his deep interest in music and emotion as inspiration for his art.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
