{"id": "swebq0189", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I would suggest you visit the Grand Canyon Village. It's a great place to start your exploration of the area. You can also take a hike along the South Rim Trail or the North Rim Tra il, depending on which side you're visiting. There are also plenty of opportunities for wildlife viewing and stargazing in the area. If you' re looking for something more adventurous, there are many hiking trails that lead down into the canyon itself.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
