{"id": "swebq0237", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, Russians are actually a very interesting people. They're one of the oldest cultures in Europe, and they have a long history that goes back to the 9th century when they first appeared on the map. So where did they originate? That' s a good question. It's hard to say for sure because there isn't really any evidence left behind, but it's believed that they came from somewhere around the U ral Mountains or maybe even further east than that.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "swebq0245", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Denmark is situated in Northern Europe, located just to the south of Sweden and west of Germany. It is an island nation with a long coastline along the Baltic Sea and the North Sea. The country consists mainly of the Jutland penin sula, which it shares with Germany, as well as numerous smaller island s, including Zealand, Funen, and Bornholm.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
